            <ArticleTitle>Technique for management of an axilloaxillary by-pass graft complicating a median sternotomy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>235-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A technique is presented for intraoperative management of an axilloaxillary by-pass graft when performing a median sternotomy for myocardial revascularization. This method allows continual perfusion of both upper extremities during the operation thereby preventing the potential complications of upper extremity or cerebral ischemia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
